    "detailed_description": "Load Slinging VR Training<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrain your professional skills in Load Slinging VR Training safely and in full correspondence with international standards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the VR simulator, you will learn how to choose the right type of slinging, depending on the process routing, which describes: the weight of the load, the dimensions of the load and the load capacity of the slings (your choice of textile or iron). You will learn how to properly hook, wrap around and install the slings for the load, make an initial lift to a height of no more than 200-300mm for spontaneous lowering of the load, and then move the load using the remote control around the hangar. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLoad Slinging VR Training was developed for professionals by professionals (including NEBOSH certified HSE). It is suitable for a wide variety of workers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur VR training is free in learning mode. Choose the subscription plan to obtain full functionality with training and exam modes, and extended usage time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you need extended corporate licensing for Load Slinging VR Training please contact us for the details.",
    "about_the_game": "Load Slinging VR Training<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrain your professional skills in Load Slinging VR Training safely and in full correspondence with international standards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the VR simulator, you will learn how to choose the right type of slinging, depending on the process routing, which describes: the weight of the load, the dimensions of the load and the load capacity of the slings (your choice of textile or iron). You will learn how to properly hook, wrap around and install the slings for the load, make an initial lift to a height of no more than 200-300mm for spontaneous lowering of the load, and then move the load using the remote control around the hangar. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nLoad Slinging VR Training was developed for professionals by professionals (including NEBOSH certified HSE). It is suitable for a wide variety of workers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur VR training is free in learning mode. Choose the subscription plan to obtain full functionality with training and exam modes, and extended usage time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you need extended corporate licensing for Load Slinging VR Training please contact us for the details.",
